# Golden vectors for the git pack index worked example.
#
# Not laid out here. git 2.47.3 wrote the index, from a repository of four
# files committed and one of them changed in a second commit -- nine
# objects -- with every name and date fixed, so the same commands write the
# same bytes:
#
#   GIT_AUTHOR_DATE=2026-11-13T00:00:00Z GIT_COMMITTER_DATE=... (and names)
#   git init -b main; printf 'file N\n' > fN for N in 1..4; git add .;
#   git commit -m one; printf 'two\n' >> f1; git commit -am two
#   git -c pack.writeReverseIndex=false repack -ad
#
# `git show-index` reads the same nine names back, in this order, each with
# its offset in the pack and its CRC-32. No pack here reaches 2 GiB, so
# `large_offsets` is empty, as it is in nearly every index there is.

pack_index nine_objects   FF 74 4F 63 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 